=== false-positive check (oracle base = always-safe) ===
always-safe, NO defense            ASR(trap)=0.250  safe-success=0.750  refused=0.000  dist={'safe': 60, 'trap': 20}
always-safe + defense=reground     ASR(trap)=0.000  safe-success=0.750  refused=0.250  dist={'safe': 60, 'refused': 20}

